Homepage: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/Weather

Package: vos-weather
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: weather forecast application for V\OS
 Weather shows the forecast for cities you pick, fetched at runtime from
 the Open-Meteo web API (geocoding and forecast endpoints, no API key
 required). It includes a preferences window, a forecast view and a
 Deskbar replicant.
